This repository is derived from and interoperates with ICH_A12_plus_Ramdisk.
The original project's authorship, MIT notice, third-party credits, and the
licenses/copyrights of all external components remain in effect.

The WSL2/Linux port adds host-side Linux/WSL integration work including native
Linux toolchain handling, APFS support under WSL2, USB/IP integration,
RestoreRamDisk injection changes, Linux-specific compatibility fixes, and
WSL build/boot/status orchestration.

This project packages and orchestrates third-party research tools. It does not
claim authorship of the underlying exploits, patchfinders, firmware formats,
or third-party utilities.

