The upstream Darwin host binaries originate from the Spironolactone /
palera1n-adjacent toolchain, including img4, trustcache, pzb, irecovery,
usbliter8_boot, and libusb components.

WSL2/Linux-specific external components additionally include projects such as
Microsoft's WSL2 Linux kernel, usbipd-win, linux-apfs/linux-apfs-rw,
apfsprogs, and native Linux builds of upstream host tools. See
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md and the license files accompanying each dependency.

